'''Raw shrimps''' can be caught at 1 [[Fishing]] with a [[small fishing net]] at a net fishing spot, granting 10 [[experience]] per catch. They can be cooked into [[shrimps]] at level 1 [[Cooking]], granting 30 Cooking experience when successful. Raw shrimps can be used as a source of food for a growing [[Cat|kitten]].

