==Fishing locations==
{{otheruses|def=no|all fishing spots|Fishing spot (small net, bait)}}
*[[Tutorial Island]]
*[[Catherby]], at the beach near [[White Wolf Mountain]].
*[[Al Kharid]], near the [[Shantay Pass]]. Beware of the level 14 [[scorpion]]s that roam around this fishing spot.
*[[Draynor Village]], near the [[willow tree]]s and the [[bank]]. Unlike Al Kharid, only level 7 [[dark wizard]]s roam here.
*[[Lumbridge Swamp]], near the [[Fishing tutor]].
